OL,3,GNEWSARhun ap Iorwerth says the Green
OL,4,AParty anti-Zionist motion was
OL,5,A"ill-judged"
OL,6,
OL,7,FRhun ap Iorwerth faced opposition
OL,8,Fleaders and Senedd members for the
OL,9,Flatest First Minister's Questions
OL,10,F(FMQs)
OL,12,FIt comes after ap Iorwerth demanded a
OL,13,F"new deal" for Wales from the UK
OL,14,Fgovernment, at Plaid Cymru's conference
OL,15,Fin Llandudno
OL,17,FAnd after Welsh Conservative Senedd
OL,18,Fleader Darren Millar told the first
OL,19,Fminister to "get on with the day job"
OL,20,Finstead of focusing on the prospect of
OL,21,Findependence, at the Tory party
OL,22,Fconference in Birmingham
